              "text": "Friday, February 14, 2014 Regulatory Notice 14-07 SEC Approves New Requirements for Alternative Trading Systems Implementation Dates: May 12, 2014 (ATS Reporting Requirement); November 10, 2014 (MPID Requirement) On October 2, 2014, FINRA filed a rule change to postpone the implementation date for the MPID requirement to February 2, 2015. On April 3, 2014, FINRA filed a rule change to amend FINRA Rule 4552 to exclude transactions in TRACE-eligible securities from the ATS weekly reporting requirements outlined in Rule 4552 and to amend the MPID requirement.",
