            "detail_content": "Notice of SFAB Election and Ballots\n\nPublished Date: 2013-10-16\n\nThe purpose of this Notice is to distribute to eligible FINRA small firms the ballots to elect a New York Region member of the Small Firm Advisory Board (SFAB). FINRA small firm members in the New York Region as of the close of business on 2013-10-15, are eligible to vote in this election. Ballots are due by Friday, 2013-11-15, and the newly elected SFAB member will take office in January 2014. Eligible firms are urged to vote in this SFAB election.\n\nDOWNLOAD AS pdf [href:https://www.finra.org/sites/default/files/NoticeDocument/p361922.pdf]",
            "detail_date_proof": "<link href=\"https://www.finra.org/rules-guidance/notices/election-notice-101613\" rel=\"canonical\"/>\n<link href=\"https://www.finra.org/node/7828\" rel=\"shortlink\"/>\n<body class=\"layout-two-sidebars page-node-7828\"></body>\n<span class=\"field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden\" id=\"node-title\"><span class=\"red-title\">Election Notice 10/16/13</span></span>\n<div class=\"field field--name-field-core-official-dt field--type-datetime field--label-inline\">\n<div class=\"field__label\">Published Date:</div>\n<div class=\"field__item\"><time class=\"datetime\" datetime=\"2013-10-16T12:00:00Z\">October 16, 2013</time>\n</div>\n</div>",
            "detail_date_proof_hash": "sha256:eadb40feddafeeaf461698a2d79f5c1de06ce382eacb324b78f35c9e67d5f7c5",
